/-!
# A129322

Triangle where the n-th row lists the smallest n positive integers which are coprime to the n-th Fibonacci number.

The 136 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `1`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

